# TheBudBoard — agent workflow

- Use **`cursor/*-132c`** branches and open PRs to **`main`**. CI auto-merges `cursor/*` when green; **`main`** deploys thebudboard.com via Cloudflare Pages.
- After merge, curl https://thebudboard.com every 30s for up to 10 minutes until the live site matches the change; if not, fix and push again without asking the user to deploy manually.
- Only escalate when a login or permission is impossible to obtain; say exactly what is missing.
- **Architecture:** logic never draws; all canvas drawing in `frontend/src/render.js`; all stats in `frontend/src/config.js`; no magic numbers in logic; delta-time loop in `main.js`.
- **Scope:** implement only the requested milestone. Test desktop keyboard and mobile touch. Finish with a brief report (built, live status, iPhone test steps).
